<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9.842 bln bfr in May.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9.842 bln bfr in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt (in billion francs):</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-May   change in mth  change in 1997</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    Belgian francs	 6,953.6   -47.2		-45.2</p>
<p>    foreign currencies     697.1   +12.4		+38.5</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    Belgian francs	 2,046.3  +172.4	     +256.0</p>
<p>    foreign currencies	86.3    +5.5		+10.9</p>
<p>Net debt		     9,842.2   +73.3	     +313.7</p>
<p>Net borrowing requirement	     56.2		259.9</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
